			"notes": "# 🚄 MinecartSpeed v1.0.0\n\nInitial public release of MinecartSpeed for Minecraft `26.2-snapshot-8`.\n\n## ✨ Features\n\n- Mouse wheel minecart speed adjustment\n- `/minecartspeed` command support\n- Persistent minecart speed saving\n- Client-server synchronization\n- Adjustable speed range from `0.1` to `10.0`\n\n## 📦 Requirements\n\n- Minecraft `26.2-snapshot-8`\n- Fabric Loader `>= 0.19.2`\n- Fabric API\n- Java `25+`\n\n## ⚠ Notes\n\nThis version is developed for Minecraft snapshots and may break between snapshot updates."
